# Test: Invalid usage of time-based set functions
# Concepts covered: membersAfter, membersBefore, membersSameTime, membersWhile, newestMember, oldestMember
# Constraints tested: Arity violations
# This test validates that violations are caught for invalid time-based set function usage.

